            "value": "Avila, I., Wisdon, B., Frandsen, C., Schroeder, A., Schermerhorn, Q., Figueroa, L., . . . Higgins, M. (2018). Lessons Learned from Assessment of Four Laboratory-Scale Sludge Dewaterability Methods Used During an Anaerobic Digestion Pilot Performed at the Robert W. Hite Treatment Facility. In Proceedings of the Water Environment Federation (Vol. 2018/4, pp. 224-241): Water Environment Federation. \r\nhttps://doi.org/10.2175/193864718824828867",
